// Rule: [T1021.004][T1059.003] Star Blizzard Redflick - SSH Local Command
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1021.004, T1059.003
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR / DeviceProcessEvents
// Required telemetry: DeviceProcessEvents
// Purpose: Hunts for ssh.exe launched with both PermitLocalCommand=yes and LocalCommand=cmd.exe, an option pairing observed in RedFlick delivery.
// Logic: Evaluate DeviceProcessEvents for ssh local command using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A result proves that the published query conditions matched in DeviceProcessEvents; it is an investigative event, not a malicious verdict.
// A match does not prove: Star Blizzard, a successful download, MSI execution, or CosmicPulse.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// Rule name: [T1021.004][T1059.003] SSH PermitLocalCommand to Local CMD Execution
// Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Confidence: Medium
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR / DeviceProcessEvents
// Objective: identify the source-observed SSH option pairing used to launch local cmd.exe.
// A match does not prove Star Blizzard, a successful download, MSI execution, or CosmicPulse.
DeviceProcessEvents
| where FileName =~ "ssh.exe"
| where ProcessCommandLine has "PermitLocalCommand=yes"
| where ProcessCommandLine has "LocalCommand=cmd.exe"
| project Timestamp, DeviceId, DeviceName,
          FileName, FolderPath, ProcessCommandLine,
          AccountName, ProcessId, ProcessUniqueId,
          InitiatingProcessFileName, InitiatingProcessCommandLine,
          InitiatingProcessParentFileName, ReportId
| order by Timestamp desc
